PUBLIC HEARING regarding a Zone Change from AR - Agricultural
Residential to LI- Light Industrial for the North 116 feet of Tracts 143
and 144, Sunnyside Addition, 5th Filing, Laramie County, WY.
24 - 229
PZ-24-00031 PC 5.9.24 Meeting Packet
Attachments:
Cate Cundall, Laramie County Planner, said that AVI, PC, on behalf of WC
Investments, Inc., submitted an application for a Zone Change at 4919 Cheyenne
Street. The application was submitted for the purpose of changing the zone district
from AR-Agricultural Residential to LI-Light Industrial to allow for an RV Storage
Facility.
The property is assessed as residential land and is bordered by LI, PUD, MR, and
MU zone districts. Some existing buildings will remain but the remainder will be
